{"logId": "73f63db0-cf3e-482d-9b5e-639a3b5d964a", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）", "block_bbox": [320, 121, 888, 165], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[320.0, 121.0], [888.0, 121.0], [888.0, 165.0], [320.0, 165.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "二级【1~2分】：不依附父母，与父母保持良好的沟通、理解和关爱，量力而行地照顾父母生活，整体和睦融洽。（传统）", "block_bbox": [308, 230, 1537, 309], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[308.0, 230.0], [1537.0, 230.0], [1537.0, 309.0], [308.0, 309.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：父母与子女两代人如果生活在一起，难免会有代沟，包括思想观念、生活方式、消费观等，偶尔有摩擦和争吵，但能够积极地化解矛盾，不形成怨恨，能改变的改变、实在不能改变就选择理解和接受，不造成精神伤害。整体来说，相互体谅和包容，也做到对父母的关心和生活上的照顾及安排。", "block_bbox": [310, 366, 1541, 490], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[310.0, 366.0], [1541.0, 366.0], [1541.0, 490.0], [310.0, 490.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [311, 555, 482, 587], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[311.0, 555.0], [482.0, 555.0], [482.0, 587.0], [311.0, 587.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、定期安排父母做全面体检（每年一次）", "block_bbox": [337, 613, 817, 645], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 613.0], [817.0, 613.0], [817.0, 645.0], [337.0, 645.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、相处中做到良好的倾听，能够对父母保持基本的体谅、理解和包容", "block_bbox": [336, 658, 1146, 690], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 658.0], [1146.0, 658.0], [1146.0, 690.0], [336.0, 690.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、双方彼此尊重对方父母，不因区别对待造成矛盾", "block_bbox": [336, 704, 937, 735], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 704.0], [937.0, 704.0], [937.0, 735.0], [336.0, 735.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、尊重父母的生活习惯，不因差异造成矛盾", "block_bbox": [338, 749, 859, 779], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[338.0, 749.0], [859.0, 749.0], [859.0, 779.0], [338.0, 779.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、合理地安排父母旅行，引导他们享受生活", "block_bbox": [337, 793, 860, 825], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 793.0], [860.0, 793.0], [860.0, 825.0], [337.0, 825.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、根据父母身体情况，在父母家中配备适用的必要药品和设施，让父母在发生紧急情况时能够自救", "block_bbox": [337, 838, 1489, 870], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 838.0], [1489.0, 838.0], [1489.0, 870.0], [337.0, 870.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[56]", "block_bbox": [916, 968, 957, 993], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[916.0, 968.0], [956.0, 968.0], [956.0, 992.0], [916.0, 992.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8284890055656433, "coordinate": [320, 121, 888, 165], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[320.0, 121.0], [888.0, 121.0], [888.0, 165.0], [320.0, 165.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7167221903800964, "coordinate": [308, 230, 1537, 309], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[308.0, 230.0], [1537.0, 230.0], [1537.0, 309.0], [308.0, 309.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9501773118972778, "coordinate": [310, 366, 1541, 490], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[310.0, 366.0], [1541.0, 366.0], [1